          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 103001,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Ok fonksiyonları</strong> oluşturmayı öğrenelim. Bunlar ES6 JavaScript standardının bir parçasıdır ve daha temiz ve kısa kod yazmak için kullanılır.</p><p>Aşağıdaki fonksiyonu yalnızca bir kod satırı kullanarak ok fonksiyonu olarak yeniden yazalım.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Hello'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Hi'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getGreeting());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greeting());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"72\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hi\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>const greeting = () =&gt; 'Hi';</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Ok fonksiyonları</strong> oluşturmayı öğrenelim. Bunlar ES6 JavaScript standardının bir parçasıdır ve daha temiz ve kısa kod yazmak için kullanılır.</p><p>Aşağıdaki fonksiyonu yalnızca bir kod satırı kullanarak ok fonksiyonu olarak yeniden yazalım.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Hello'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Hi'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getGreeting());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greeting());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greeting\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getGreeting\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hi\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>const greeting = () =&gt; 'Hi';</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Anonymous Function",
            "id": 103846,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Arrow fonksiyonları, <strong>anonim</strong><strong>fonksiyon</strong> türündedir; yani bir fonksiyon adları yoktur.</p><p>Bu fonksiyonları çağırmak istiyorsak onları bir değişkenin içinde saklamamız ve sonunda parantezlerle değişkeni çağırmamız gerekir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Hi'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getGreeting());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greeting());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"131\" endIndex=\"141\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Greetings!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hi\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>const greeting</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>greeting()</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Arrow fonksiyonları, <strong>anonim</strong><strong>fonksiyon</strong> türündedir; yani bir fonksiyon adları yoktur.</p><p>Bu fonksiyonları çağırmak istiyorsak onları bir değişkenin içinde saklamamız ve sonunda parantezlerle değişkeni çağırmamız gerekir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Hi'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getGreeting());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greeting());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"131\" endIndex=\"141\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greeting\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getGreeting\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Greetings!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hi\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>const greeting</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>greeting()</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
