          {
            "title": "Parentheses",
            "id": 103847,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ok fonksiyonlarıyla <code>function</code> anahtar kelimesine veya fonksiyon adına ihtiyacımız olmaz. Bu, başlangıçta kullandığımız ilk şeyin parantezler olduğu anlamına gelir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>(</code>, ardından <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Parameter",
            "id": 103848,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Normal fonksiyonlarda olduğu gibi, parantezlerin içine parametreler ekleyebilir ve ardından parametreleri fonksiyonun içinde kullanabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"firstName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + firstName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"firstName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + firstName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greeting(\" /><text value=\"'Tony'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"136\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Greetings Tony\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>firstName</code>, ardından <code>firstName</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Normal fonksiyonlarda olduğu gibi, parantezlerin içine parametreler ekleyebilir ve ardından parametreleri fonksiyonun içinde kullanabiliriz.</p><p>Normal fonksiyondakiyle aynı parametre adını kullan ve bu argümandan oluşturulan selamlamayı döndür.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"firstName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + firstName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"firstName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + firstName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greeting(\" /><text value=\"'Tony'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"136\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.log\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getGreeting\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'Tony'\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Greetings Tony\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>firstName</code>, ardından <code>return</code> ve son olarak <code>firstName</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Arrow operator",
            "id": 103004,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parantezlerden hemen sonra ve açılış süslü parantezinden önce ok operatörünü <code>=&gt;</code> ekleriz.</p><p>Bu operatörü, fonksiyonun yürütmesini istediğimiz kod bloğundan veya ifadeden hemen önce kullanırız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hello = \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"myfunction\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" helloArrowFunction = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hello());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(helloArrowFunction());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"95\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Greetings!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Greetings \" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>=&gt;</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parantezlerden hemen sonra ve açılış süslü parantezinden önce ok operatörünü <code>=&gt;</code> ekleriz.</p><p>Bu operatörü, fonksiyonun yürütmesini istediğimiz kod bloğundan veya ifadeden hemen önce kullanırız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hello = \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"myfunction\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" helloArrowFunction = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hello());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(helloArrowFunction());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greeting\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getGreeting\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Greetings!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Greetings \" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>=&gt;</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Multiple body statements",
            "id": 103005,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Geleneksel fonksiyonlarda olduğu gibi, bir arrow function'ın kod bloğunu kapsamak için süslü parantezleri <code>{}</code> kullanırız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"'Elizabeth'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>{</code>, ardından <code>};</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Geleneksel fonksiyonlarda olduğu gibi, bir arrow function'ın kod bloğunu kapsamak için süslü parantezleri <code>{}</code> kullanırız.</p><p>Bloğu tamamla ve yerel <code>name</code> değişkenini kullanarak bir selamlama döndür.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"'Elizabeth'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greetings\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>{</code>, ardından <code>name</code> ve son olarak <code>};</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "One body statement",
            "id": 103006,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir ok fonksiyonunda yalnızca bir ifade varsa, oldukça kısa bir kod elde etmek için hem süslü parantezleri hem de <code>return</code> anahtar kelimesini yazmayabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{ return 'Greetings' }\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>'Greetings'</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir ok fonksiyonunda yalnızca bir ifade varsa, oldukça kısa bir kod elde etmek için hem süslü parantezleri hem de <code>return</code> anahtar kelimesini yazmayabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{ return 'Greetings' }\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>greetings</code>, ardından <code>'Greetings'</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Arrow operator",
            "id": 103700,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ok operatörünü <code>=&gt;</code> nereye ekleriz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Parantezlerden sonra ve açılan süslü parantezden önce</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>function</code> anahtar sözcüğünden sonra ve açılış küme ayracından <code>{</code> önce</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Parantezlerden sonra ve açılan süslü parantezden önce.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>name</code> parametresini alan bir ok fonksiyonu yazmaya başlıyorsun. Hangi parça parametre listesini kod bloğuna doğru şekilde bağlar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>(name) =&gt; {</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=&gt; (name) {</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>(name) { =&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>(name) =&gt; {</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple body statements",
            "id": 103701,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir arrow function'da süslü parantezler <code>{}</code> ne işe yarar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kod bloğunu içerirler</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir fonksiyonu çağırmak için kullanılırlar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kod bloğunu içerirler.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>const getScore = () =&gt; { return 10; };</code> içinde ok fonksiyonunun süslü parantezleri hangi bölümü içerir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>return 10;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>() =&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>getScore()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>return 10;</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
