            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki kodu nasıl kısaltabiliriz?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Küme parantezlerini <code>{}</code> ve <code>return</code> anahtar kelimesini kaldırarak</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Parantezleri <code>()</code> kaldırarak</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Küme parantezlerini <code>{}</code> ve <code>return</code> anahtar kelimesini kaldırarak.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu fonksiyonu kısaltırken yine de <code>\"Hello\"</code> döndürmesini istiyorsun. Hangi ifade aynı sonucu verir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>const greetings = () =&gt; \"Hello\";</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>const greetings = =&gt; \"Hello\";</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>const greetings = () =&gt; { \"Hello\"; };</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>const greetings = () =&gt; \"Hello\";</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Calling the function",
            "id": 103704,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki arrow function'ı nasıl çağırırız?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" position = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello Jane!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>greetings();</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>greetings;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>greetings();</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>greetings</code> fonksiyonunu çalıştırıp döndürdüğü metni <code>message</code> içinde saklaman gerekiyor. Bunu hangi satır yapar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" position = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello Jane!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>const message = greetings();</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>const message = greetings;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>const message = greetings.position;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>const message = greetings();</code>.</p></body></html>"
